petting-success-tiger = You pet the tiger on the head. It growls unhappily.
petting-failure-tiger = The tiger growls and pushes your hand away.

petting-success-crocodile = You pet the crocodile. It stares at you motionlessly.
petting-failure-crocodile = The crocodile snaps its jaws.

petting-success-turtle = You pet the turtle on the sensitive parts of its shell.
petting-failure-turtle = The turtle hides in its shell.

petting-success-rabbit = You pet the rabbit. It twitches its ears.
petting-failure-rabbit = The rabbit runs away from you.

petting-success-seal = You slap the seal on its jiggly belly.
petting-failure-seal = The seal dodges your hand.
